{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/posts/jwplayer/events_sharing_viewability_volume/","result":{"data":{"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"html":"<h2 id=\"sharing-events\" style=\"position:relative;\">Sharing Events<a href=\"#sharing-events\" aria-label=\"sharing events permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>공유(Sharing) API 호출은 <code class=\"language-text\">getPlugin()</code> 메서드와 함께 동작합니다.<br>\n예를 들어, 모든 공유 인스턴스는 이 특정 플러그인을 참조하기 위해<br>\n<code class=\"language-text\">getPlugin('sharing')</code> API 호출을 사용합니다.</p>\n<p>다음 예시는 공유 플러그인을 대상으로 합니다:</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-javascript line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-javascript\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">on</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'ready'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">function</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">event</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  sharingPlugin <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">jwplayer</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">getPlugin</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'sharing'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p>이후 나오는 <strong>모든 <code class=\"language-text\">sharingPlugin</code> 참조</strong>는<br>\n위 코드가 <strong>페이지 내에 구현되어 있다고 가정합니다.</strong></p>\n<h3 id=\"sharingonopen\" style=\"position:relative;\">(“sharing”).on(‘open’)<a href=\"#sharingonopen\" aria-label=\"sharingonopen permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>공유(Sharing) 플러그인이 <strong>열릴 때</strong> 감지합니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"json\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-json line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token property\">\"visible\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">true</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token property\">\"method\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"interaction\"</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>method</strong> (string)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>공유 메뉴가 열리게 된 방식</li>\n<li>가능한 값:&#x3C;\n<ul>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">interaction</code>: 클릭, 터치, 키보드 입력</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>visible</strong> (string)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>공유 메뉴의 표시 여부</li>\n<li>이 값은 항상 <code class=\"language-text\">true</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"sharingonclose\" style=\"position:relative;\">(“sharing”).on(‘close’)<a href=\"#sharingonclose\" aria-label=\"sharingonclose permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>공유(Sharing) 플러그인이 <strong>닫힐 때</strong> 감지합니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"json\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-json line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token property\">\"visible\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">false</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token property\">\"method\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"interaction\"</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>method</strong> (string)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>공유 메뉴가 열리게 된 방식</li>\n<li>가능한 값:\n<ul>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">interaction</code>: 클릭, 터치, 키보드 입력</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>visible</strong> (string)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>공유 메뉴의 표시 여부</li>\n<li>이 값은 항상 <code class=\"language-text\">false</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"sharingonclick\" style=\"position:relative;\">(“sharing”).on(‘click’)<a href=\"#sharingonclick\" aria-label=\"sharingonclick permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>공유(Sharing) 플러그인 내에서 <strong>사용자가 콘텐츠를 공유할 때마다</strong> 트리거됩니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jso\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-jso line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-jso\">{\r\n  &quot;method&quot;: &quot;facebook&quot;\r\n}</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>method</strong> (string)\n<ul>\n<li>사용된 공유 방식의 라벨</li>\n<li>가능한 값:\n<ul>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">email</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">facebook</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">link</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">twitter</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"viewability-events\" style=\"position:relative;\">Viewability Events<a href=\"#viewability-events\" aria-label=\"viewability events permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<blockquote class=\"prompt-tip\">\n<p>iframe 환경에서는 viewability API 사용을 권장하지 않습니다.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"oncontainerviewable\" style=\"position:relative;\">.on(‘containerViewable’)<a href=\"#oncontainerviewable\" aria-label=\"oncontainerviewable permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>플레이어 컨테이너(<code class=\"language-text\">&lt;div></code> 요소)의 <strong>가시성(viewability)</strong> 상태를 나타내는 이벤트가 트리거됩니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"json\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-json line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token property\">\"viewable\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token property\">\"type\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"containerViewable\"</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>type</strong> (string)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>이벤트의 유형</li>\n<li>이 값은 항상 <code class=\"language-text\">\"containerViewable\"</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>viewable</strong> (boolean)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>플레이어 컨테이너의 가시성 상태</li>\n<li>가능한 값:\n<ul>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">0</code>: 플레이어 컨테이너가 화면에 보이지 않음</li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">1</code>: 플레이어 컨테이너가 화면에 보임</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"onviewable\" style=\"position:relative;\">.on(‘viewable’)<a href=\"#onviewable\" aria-label=\"onviewable permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>플레이어의 <strong>가시성(viewability)</strong> 상태를 나타내는 이벤트가 트리거됩니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"json\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-json line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token property\">\"viewable\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token property\">\"type\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"viewable\"</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>type</strong> (string)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>이벤트의 유형</li>\n<li>이 값은 항상 <code class=\"language-text\">\"viewable\"</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>viewable</strong> (boolean)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>플레이어의 가시성 상태</li>\n<li>가능한 값:\n<ul>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">0</code>: 플레이어가 화면에 보이지 않음</li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">1</code>: 플레이어가 화면에 보임</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"volume-events\" style=\"position:relative;\">Volume Events<a href=\"#volume-events\" aria-label=\"volume events permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"onmute\" style=\"position:relative;\">.on(‘mute’)<a href=\"#onmute\" aria-label=\"onmute permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>플레이어가 <strong>음소거 상태로 전환되거나 해제될 때</strong> 트리거됩니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"json\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-json line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token property\">\"mute\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">true</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token property\">\"type\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"mute\"</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>event</strong> (string)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>이벤트의 유형</li>\n<li>이 속성의 값은 항상 <code class=\"language-text\">\"volume\"</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>mute</strong> (boolean)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>플레이어의 새로운 음소거 상태</li>\n<li>가능한 값:\n<ul>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">true</code></li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">false</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"onvolume\" style=\"position:relative;\">.on(‘volume’)<a href=\"#onvolume\" aria-label=\"onvolume permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>플레이어의 <strong>볼륨이 변경될 때</strong> 트리거됩니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"json\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-json line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token property\">\"volume\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">73</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token property\">\"type\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"volume\"</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>type</strong> (string)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>이벤트의 유형</li>\n<li>이 속성의 값은 항상 <code class=\"language-text\">\"volume\"</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>volume</strong> (number)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>새로운 볼륨 비율 (0–100)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>","tableOfContents":"<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#sharing-events\">Sharing Events</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#sharingonopen\">(“sharing”).on(‘open’)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#sharingonclose\">(“sharing”).on(‘close’)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#sharingonclick\">(“sharing”).on(‘click’)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#viewability-events\">Viewability Events</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#oncontainerviewable\">.on(‘containerViewable’)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#onviewable\">.on(‘viewable’)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#volume-events\">Volume Events</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#onmute\">.on(‘mute’)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#onvolume\">.on(‘volume’)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>","fields":{"gitLastModified":"Oct 7, 2026"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Events - Sharing, Viewability, Volume","summary":"Sharing Events 공유(Sharing) API 호출은 getPlugin() 메서드와 함께 동작합니다. 예를 들어, 모든 공유 인스턴스는 이 특정 플러그인을 참조하기 위해 getPlugin(\"sharing\") API 호출을 사용합니다. 다음 예시는 공유 플러그인을 대상으로 합니다:","date":"Mar 20, 2025","categories":["JWPlayer"],"tags":[""],"author":["aluvy"],"thumbnail":null}}}]}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/posts/jwplayer/events_sharing_viewability_volume/","prev":{"slug":"/posts/jwplayer/events_seek/","title":"Events - Seek"},"next":{"slug":"/posts/highcharts/01_install/","title":"Installation"}}},"staticQueryHashes":["1397594759","2043619371"],"slicesMap":{}}